Would create container rc-golden-master-root-workspace for <GM_ROOT>/workspace
Would mount <GM_ROOT>/workspace -> /workspace
Would mount ~/.claude/projects -> /home/agent/.claude/projects (sessions persist to host, rip-cage-dn2)
Would mount ~/.claude/sessions -> /home/agent/.claude/sessions
Would set RC_HOST_PROJECT_KEY=<GM_ROOT_SLUG>-workspace (unifies -workspace sessions with host project key)
Would run init script
Would run: msb create --conf <GM_ROOT>/home/.config/rip-cage/projects/rc-golden-master-root-workspace.yaml --name rc-golden-master-root-workspace --log-level trace --net-default deny --net-rule allow@api.github.com:tcp:443 --net-rule allow@doltremoteapi.dolthub.com:tcp:443 --net-rule allow@files.pythonhosted.org:tcp:443 --net-rule allow@github.com:tcp:443 --net-rule allow@pypi.org:tcp:443 --workdir /workspace -e PI_CODING_AGENT_DIR=/home/agent/.pi/agent -v <GM_ROOT>/home/.pi/agent/auth.json:/home/agent/.pi/agent/auth.json -e CAGE_HOST_ADDR=host.microsandbox.internal -v <GM_ROOT>/home/.claude/projects:/home/agent/.claude/projects -v <GM_ROOT>/home/.claude/sessions:/home/agent/.claude/sessions -e RC_HOST_PROJECT_KEY=<GM_ROOT_SLUG>-workspace --cpus=2 --memory=4g